		<description><![CDATA[Don&#8217;t be sad.  I was sad too.  At first.  I truly believed that everybody had some good in them.  We want to trust everything and everyone.  We want to believe that all behavior is learned and therefore preventable.  It&#8217;s not.  A psychopath can vary quite a bit in actual behavior, but their context of ruthless [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="simplesocialbuttons">
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="Your blog makes me sad" data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/83" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
